{"obsah":"<p><strong><br>17/5 – Cycling day exhibition – Droužkovice</strong></p>\n\n<p>A small village in the north held a cycling day, and our team – Lukáš Valný, Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček and kids from the club – was invited too. Unfortunately the weather was a bit harsher, and the temperature with the possibility of a storm didn't attract many spectators. Anyway, a few true believers came, so we could show them a bit of Trial riding over obstacles, and after the exhibition Vlasta tried some gaps onto a tree trunk and the local walls in the grounds.</p>\n\n<p><strong>31/5 – Triple exhibition – all over the Czech Republic</strong></p>\n\n<p>Storms wherever you looked, but a pleasant temperature. We played roulette all over the Czech Republic. Near Jablůnkov, Lukáš Valný and Michal Budský started their exhibition at the edge of a storm cloud, but everything went as it should. Martin Šimůnek took his workshop to Moravia, where he managed to ride part of the programme before the rest was unfortunately washed out. And the biggest group – Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček and the kids, Marek Tryner as host and Tobík Dolák as workshop instructor – headed to Most. Unfortunately, due to a knee injury, Mára is having ligament surgery in a few days, and Tobík Dolák overdid his training enthusiasm and found out what it's like to land on your tailbone from height. So the riding was on Vlasta and the kids, followed by a workshop on Trial bikes and obstacles. Luckily the weather turned out ideal, so mission accomplished on all fronts.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FBECA0FF7-245E-4720-ADE0-FD83F7DAE968.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FBECA0FF7-245E-4720-ADE0-FD83F7DAE968.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250806\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FIMG_9477.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FIMG_9477.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250810\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FIMG_9478.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FIMG_9478.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250809\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FIMG_9481.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FIMG_9481.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250811\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FIMG_9491.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FIMG_9491.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250807\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FIMG_9492.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2